{"data": [{"author_id": "838635277", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:39:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116434786797654419"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The first patient received a dose of the high-precision gene editor in a new clinical trial for Wilson disease. Researchers hope it's a one-and-done fix.", "display_url": "singularityhub.com/2026/10/29/cri…", "end": 69, "expanded_url": "https://singularityhub.com/2026/10/29/crispr-prime-editing-rewrites-dna-in-the-human-body-for-the-first-time/", "images": [{"height": 929, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115907556568657920/RZWWJ-TD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1300}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115907556568657920/RZWWJ-TD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 46, "status": 200, "title": "CRISPR Prime Editing Rewrites DNA in the Human Body for the First Time", "unwound_url": "https://singularityhub.com/2026/10/29/crispr-prime-editing-rewrites-dna-in-the-human-body-for-the-first-time/", "url": "https://t.co/9Ocan91UBT"}]}, "id": "2116434786797654419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1187, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "CRISPR Prime Editing Alters Human DNA In Vivo https://t.co/9Ocan91UBT", "url": "https://x.com/CrisprGlenn/status/2116434786797654419"}, {"author_id": "1255316414", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:37:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116932620781269040"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 105, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?utm_source=superhuman&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=sunday-special-virgin-galactic-unveils-a-six-seat-spaceship&_bhlid=55497fd4b268660a5082beee02354cf34d74494a", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116932686845730816/oKSdhAiU?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116932686845730816/oKSdhAiU?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 82, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?utm_source=superhuman&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=sunday-special-virgin-galactic-unveils-a-six-seat-spaceship&_bhlid=55497fd4b268660a5082beee02354cf34d74494a&error=cookies_not_supported&code=2f11b9c8-3d28-465b-8b8c-b84deed72a1d", "url": "https://t.co/Urlad2MKQY"}]}, "id": "2116932620781269040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body\n\nhttps://t.co/Urlad2MKQY", "url": "https://x.com/JamesDiGiorgio/status/2116932620781269040"}, {"author_id": "2110437865809174528", "created_at": "2026-10-31T16:42:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116571641379786940"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 173, "start": 166, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 186, "start": 174, "tag": "GeneEditing"}], "urls": [{"description": "Can rewriting DNA change the future for families living with rare g...", "display_url": "youtu.be/bsjvU2BFTxo", "end": 240, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/bsjvU2BFTxo", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116571689635270656/QNblELZ9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116571689635270656/QNblELZ9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 217, "status": 200, "title": "David Liu: Gene Editing to Treat Rare Disease", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bsjvU2BFTxo&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/r1ZeMwYDyo"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/O33pvznki0", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GENErationHopee/status/2116571641379786940/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116571524232589312", "start": 241, "url": "https://t.co/O33pvznki0"}]}, "id": "2116571641379786940", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why cutting DNA isn't enough: Dr. David R. Liu on why most genetic diseases need the broken gene fixed, not just disrupted, and how that idea launched base editing.\n\n#CRISPR #GeneEditing\n\nWatch the full conversation: https://t.co/r1ZeMwYDyo https://t.co/O33pvznki0", "url": "https://x.com/GENErationHopee/status/2116571641379786940"}, {"author_id": "853318060052291584", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:09:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116502853338517576"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TiKCfqAhJ7", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OwenGregorian/status/2116502853338517576/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116502848997310465", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/TiKCfqAhJ7"}]}, "id": "2116502853338517576", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4344, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Scientists just attempted to rewrite a patient’s DNA inside their body for the first time | Tudor Tarita, ZME Science\n\nA single infusion could one day treat an inherited disease at its source. But first, researchers must find out whether the experimental gene editor actually https://t.co/TiKCfqAhJ7", "url": "https://x.com/OwenGregorian/status/2116502853338517576"}, {"author_id": "1451521091567034393", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:51:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116634289198788979"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Base editors are useful tools that allow genetic engineers to precisely change single bases in an organism's genome. Most base editors catalyze transition mutations (e.g., A-to-G or C to-T). Transversion mutations, which convert a purine base to a pyrimidine base, have been described but operate at much lower efficiency. Here, we describe a surprising discovery that a transition base editor produced high-efficiency transversion mutations in a species of Streptomyces. This information was used to engineer a high-efficiency transversion base editor.", "display_url": "journals.asm.org/doi/10.1128/jb…", "end": 89, "expanded_url": "https://journals.asm.org/doi/10.1128/jb.00241-26", "images": [{"height": 3300, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116634294148034560/Nn2ZM4n6?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2550}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116634294148034560/Nn2ZM4n6?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 66, "status": 200, "title": "Strain-specific outcomes of cytosine-base editing in Streptomyces | Journal of Bacteriology", "unwound_url": "https://journals.asm.org/doi/10.1128/jb.00241-26", "url": "https://t.co/HK6GEq2CLy"}]}, "id": "2116634289198788979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 237, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Strain-specific outcomes of cytosine-base editing in Streptomyces https://t.co/HK6GEq2CLy", "url": "https://x.com/BaharogluZeynep/status/2116634289198788979"}, {"author_id": "1421813574230552581", "created_at": "2026-10-31T07:25:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116431398626329024"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/JerryCardsUSA/…", "end": 195, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/JerryCardsUSA/status/2116021249394552940", "start": 172, "url": "https://t.co/hCPb3vpmEj"}]}, "id": "2116431398626329024", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116021249394552940", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Prime Medicine dosed the first patient with prime editing inside the body, rewriting liver DNA for Wilson's disease. gene editing moved from the lab bench into the patient https://t.co/hCPb3vpmEj", "url": "https://x.com/TheRealKaien/status/2116431398626329024"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:13:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116639598424011167"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature Biotechnology - Human Argonaute is repurposed for RNA editing.", "display_url": "doi.org/10.1038/s41587…", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41587-026-03359-y", "images": [{"height": 1518, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116639610298101760/PEF9DNZI?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2164}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116639610298101760/PEF9DNZI?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 135, "status": 200, "title": "Engineered human Argonaute 2 for targeted C-to-U RNA base editing", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41587-026-03359-y?error=cookies_not_supported&code=df7127e5-0811-4fad-93f7-a4828abd95c9", "url": "https://t.co/jXbgdwqNtX"}]}, "id": "2116639598424011167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 393, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Engineered human Argonaute 2 for targeted C-to-U RNA base editing.\nLusi RF, von Hase SM, Model C, Banik SM\nNat Biotechnol. 2026-10-20.\nhttps://t.co/jXbgdwqNtX\nArgonote 2(AGO2) + APOBEC3A(A3A)", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2116639598424011167"}, {"author_id": "2106638884113088512", "created_at": "2026-10-31T09:03:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116455919395754011"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 184, "start": 176, "tag": "Science"}, {"end": 190, "start": 186, "tag": "ADN"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sRaupwKaDE", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LeCarnetdeNova/status/2116455919395754011/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116455574489407488", "start": 191, "url": "https://t.co/sRaupwKaDE"}]}, "id": "2116455919395754011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Une première mondiale : le Prime Editing ouvre une nouvelle voie pour modifier l'ADN directement dans le corps humain !\n\nDécouvrez cette avancée dans notre nouvelle vidéo ! 👇\n\n#Science  #ADN https://t.co/sRaupwKaDE", "url": "https://x.com/LeCarnetdeNova/status/2116455919395754011"}, {"author_id": "1432037813894225923", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:20:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116611256958496784"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Ένα σημαντικό ορόσημο στη γενετική ιατρική καταγράφηκε τον Οκτώβριο του 2026, καθώς χορηγήθηκε για πρώτη φορά σε άνθρωπο θεραπεία που βασίζεται στην τεχνολογία prime editing και τροποποιεί το DNA απευθείας…", "display_url": "generegther.gr/information/pr…", "end": 155, "expanded_url": "https://generegther.gr/information/prime-editing-", "images": [{"height": 1125, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116611279771320320/BRHESFE9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116611279771320320/BRHESFE9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 132, "status": 200, "title": "Prime Editing: Για πρώτη φορά, γονιδιακή επεξεργασία απευθείας μέσα στο ανθρώπινο σώμα για τη νόσο Wilson - Ελληνική Εταιρεία Γονιδιακής Θεραπείας και Αναγεννητικής Ιατρικής", "unwound_url": "https://generegther.gr/information/prime-editing-%ce%b3%ce%b9%ce%b1-%cf%80%cf%81%cf%8e%cf%84%ce%b7-%cf%86%ce%bf%cf%81%ce%ac-%ce%b3%ce%bf%ce%bd%ce%b9%ce%b4%ce%b9%ce%b1%ce%ba%ce%ae-%ce%b5%cf%80%ce%b5%ce%be%ce%b5%cf%81%ce%b3%ce%b1%cf%83/", "url": "https://t.co/44H14AYJPs"}]}, "id": "2116611256958496784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Check out this article: Prime Editing: Για πρώτη φορά, γονιδιακή επεξεργασία απευθείας μέσα στο ανθρώπινο σώμα για τ