://youtu.be/7PuvpcZ17UY", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116536612578611200/KbESqsFL?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116536612578611200/KbESqsFL?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 182, "status": 200, "title": "Longevity News Roundup 2026 October 30th", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7PuvpcZ17UY&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/ABBGdgmUve"}]}, "id": "2116536607805415444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Vaccine vs. \"zombie\" senescent cells, NAD boosters &amp; the aging heart, statins &amp; bone, REM sleep &amp; memory, first in-body prime editing. Halloween Longevity News Roundup 🎃 https://t.co/ABBGdgmUve", "url": "https://x.com/AgeBiotech/status/2116536607805415444"}, {"author_id": "2046946936373350400", "created_at": "2026-10-31T02:05:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116350927070429571"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 204, "start": 199, "tag": "PRME"}, {"end": 209, "start": 205, "tag": "XBI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/srqstockpicker…", "end": 233, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/srqstockpicker/status/2116321871578751271", "start": 210, "url": "https://t.co/NByGGLZaKi"}]}, "id": "2116350927070429571", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 382, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116321871578751271", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Another recent paper describes the development of a free machine learning tool called OptiPrime to predict prime editing outcomes. “We can’t call it Optimus Prime or Hasbro would sue us,” Liu joked. $PRME $XBI https://t.co/NByGGLZaKi", "url": "https://x.com/Calmlifetale/status/2116350927070429571"}, {"author_id": "1798401367146450945", "created_at": "2026-11-01T14:04:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116894027890950354"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 195, "start": 179, "tag": "Alpha1Awareness"}, {"end": 207, "start": 196, "tag": "LungHealth"}, {"end": 220, "start": 208, "tag": "LiverHealth"}, {"end": 233, "start": 221, "tag": "RareDisease"}, {"end": 239, "start": 234, "tag": "AATD"}, {"end": 247, "start": 240, "tag": "Alpha1"}, {"end": 260, "start": 248, "tag": "GeneTherapy"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RrjMuAWIPW", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheEduPatient/status/2116894027890950354/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116894025433145344", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/RrjMuAWIPW"}]}, "id": "2116894027890950354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Could AATD one day be treated at its root cause? An early trial of a one-time base-editing therapy restored working AAT protein in people with severe AATD. Here’s what to know. \n\n#Alpha1Awareness #LungHealth #LiverHealth #RareDisease #AATD #Alpha1 #GeneTherapy\n\nLearn more: https://t.co/RrjMuAWIPW", "url": "https://x.com/TheEduPatient/status/2116894027890950354"}, {"author_id": "64375648", "created_at": "2026-11-01T07:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116790341864947930"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 192, "start": 177, "tag": "WilsonsDisease"}, {"end": 207, "start": 193, "tag": "GenomeEditing"}, {"end": 214, "start": 208, "tag": "Genes"}, {"end": 219, "start": 215, "tag": "DNA"}, {"end": 235, "start": 220, "tag": "GeneticDisease"}, {"end": 243, "start": 236, "tag": "Genome"}, {"end": 258, "start": 244, "tag": "ClinicalTrial"}], "mentions": [{"end": 17, "id": "1191016766669021184", "start": 3, "username": "DanH_Jacobson"}], "urls": [{"description": "The first patient has received an experimental prime-editing therapy in a clinical trial for Wilson's disease.", "display_url": "progress.org.uk/first-patient-…", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://www.progress.org.uk/first-patient-receives-prime-editing-therapy-for-wilsons-disease/", "images": [{"height": 1280, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116790389600333824/S63xCSKe?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116790389600333824/S63xCSKe?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 153, "status": 200, "title": "First patient receives prime editing therapy for Wilson's disease | PET", "unwound_url": "https://www.progress.org.uk/first-patient-receives-prime-editing-therapy-for-wilsons-disease/", "url": "https://t.co/fS0jvfYVP8"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/El5rgkMCKn", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PET_BioNews/status/2116790341864947930/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116684677759000576", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/El5rgkMCKn"}]}, "id": "2116790341864947930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dr @DanH_Jacobson explains that prime editing is a type of genome editing which is ‘used to alter DNA directly inside a person’s body’ \nRead in BioNews: https://t.co/fS0jvfYVP8\n#WilsonsDisease #GenomeEditing #Genes #DNA #GeneticDisease #Genome #ClinicalTrial https://t.co/El5rgkMCKn", "url": "https://x.com/PET_BioNews/status/2116790341864947930"}, {"author_id": "2035340237858320384", "created_at": "2026-11-01T17:06:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116939845335498987"], "id": "2116939845335498987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Wuhan University team modified every region of the prime editing guide RNA, not just the ends. At 1 mg/kg in mice, editing at Pcsk9 reached about 51% against 0.6% for end-modified pegRNA, and serum Pcsk9 fell 96%. Published in Nature Biomedical Engineering.", "url": "https://x.com/EarnestPen/status/2116939845335498987"}, {"author_id": "2057503590995099655", "created_at": "2026-11-01T04:21:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116747388366795185"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4kxkZ3JL8Q", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CliffS58597/status/2116747388366795185/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116747350441967616", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/4kxkZ3JL8Q"}]}, "id": "2116747388366795185", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 84, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A lot of news overnight. Check out what's been going on. NEWS songs are made with the assistance of the Grok a.i. devils. \n\nThe last 24 hours (roughly Oct 30–31, 2026) have been dominated by the ongoing US-Israel war with Iran (around Day 244), Houthi strikes on Saudi Arabia, https://t.co/4kxkZ3JL8Q", "url": "https://x.com/CliffS58597/status/2116747388366795185"}, {"author_id": "25950355", "created_at": "2026-11-01T18:00:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116953529193578788"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/H9mzuFtVB6", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NEJM/status/2116953529193578788/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116953450369916928", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/H9mzuFtVB6"}]}, "id": "2116953529193578788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4596, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "A Brief Report published in May of 2025 describes a lipid nanoparticle–delivered base-editing therapy that was custom designed for an infant with a urea-cycle disorder. A Clinical Implications of Basic Research published in April 2026 reviews another approach to genetic therapy: https://t.co/H9mzuFtVB6", "url": "https://x.com/NEJM/status/2116953529193578788"}, {"author_id": "1360769400182341641", "created_at": "2026-11-01T18:29:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116960954378600657"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 61, "start": 56, "tag": "ARKG"